---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['file-diagram', {compact}]} role="img" aria-label="Conceptual architecture: a sensitive file is fragmented and encrypted, then protected fragments are distributed across three logical storage locations. Authorized access reconstructs the file. The network version is upcoming.">
<div class="diagram-top"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> FILE-LEVEL PROTECTION</span><span>FIG. 01</span></div>
<div class="diagram-stage">
<div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
<div class="source-file"><svg viewBox="0 0 44 52" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2h19l12 12v36H8z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M27 2v13h12M15 25h17M15 32h17M15 39h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg><span>SENSITIVE FILE</span></div>
<svg class="diagram-connections" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M300 92V138M300 209V250M300 250H95V290M300 250V290M300 250H505V290" fill="none" stroke="#7eae8a" stroke-width="1"/><path class="flow-line" d="M300 92V138M300 209V250M300 250H95V290M300 250V290M300 250H505V290" fill="none" stroke="#d3ef74" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 55"/></svg>
<div class="protection-core"><span class="core-icon">⌘</span><div><strong>Fragment + encrypt</strong><span>PROTECT AT THE FILE LEVEL</span></div><svg width="18" height="22" viewBox="0 0 18 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="9" width="14" height="11" rx="2" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M5 9V5a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor"/></svg></div>
<div class="diagram-stores">{['A','B','C'].map((letter,i)=><div class="storage-node"><div class="fragment-stack">{[0,1,2].map(n=><span class:list={['fragment',`fragment-${(n+i)%3}`]}><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>)}</div><span>LOCATION {letter}</span><small>Protected fragments</small></div>)}</div>
</div><div class="diagram-bottom"><span class="diagram-lock">◇</span><span>Distributed fragments.<br/><strong>Controlled reconstruction.</strong></span><span class="diagram-badge">DEFENSE IN DEPTH</span></div><p class="diagram-caption">Conceptual illustration · Network architecture upcoming</p>
</div>
